<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.3.5">
<l>kālu meḻākaṇṇa nīrumnil lāvuṭal cōrntu naṭuṅkikural</l>
<l>mēlu meḻāmayirk kūccu maṟāveṉa tōḷkaḷum vīḻvoḻiyā</l>
<l>mālu kaḷāniṟku meṉmaṉa ṉēyuṉṉai vāḻatta laippeytiṭṭēṉ</l>
<l>cēluka ḷāniṟkum nīḷcuṉai cūḻtiru māliruñ cōlaiyentāy.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>[I] cannot lift [my] legs, [my] eyes won’t stop watering,</l>
<l rend="indent">[my] body languishes and quivers,</l>
<l>[I] cannot raise [my] voice, [my] hair endlessly bristles,</l>
<l rend="indent">my shoulders unceasingly droop,</l>
<l>my mind keeps slipping into delusion –</l>
<l rend="indent">I joined you in order to live!</l>
<l>My father in Tirumāliruñcōlai surrounded by wide pools</l>
<l rend="indent">where carp leap.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
